2. Zevaro 前端搜尋核心架構
透過 JavaScript 讀取 GitHub Raw / CDN 資料，並建立記憶體內的極速檢索：

JavaScript
// Zevaro Search Core Engine
class ZevaroEngine {
  constructor() {
    this.rawUrl = 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/YOUR_GITHUB_USER/zevaro-data@main/zevaro-products.json';
    this.products = [];
  }

  // 1. 初始化並載入產品資料
  async init() {
    try {
      const response = await fetch(this.rawUrl);
      this.products = await response.json();
      console.log('✅ Zevaro Engine Ready! Loaded:', this.products.length, 'products');
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('❌ Failed to load Zevaro product database:', error);
    }
  }

  // 2. 搜尋與多維度過濾
  search({ keyword = '', category = 'All' }) {
    return this.products.filter(product => {
      // 關鍵字比對 (名稱、描述、標籤)
      const query = keyword.toLowerCase();
      const matchKeyword = !keyword || 
        product.name.toLowerCase().includes(query) ||
        product.summary.toLowerCase().includes(query) ||
        product.tags.some(tag => tag.toLowerCase().includes(query));

      // 分類過濾
      const matchCategory = category === 'All' || product.category === category;

      return matchKeyword && matchCategory;
    });
  }
}

// 使用方式範例
const zevaro = new ZevaroEngine();
await zevaro.init();
const results = zevaro.search({ keyword: 'Cloud' });
console.log('Search Results:', results);
3. Zevaro 企業級 CI/CD 自動化流程 (GitHub Actions)
當團隊成員新增或更新 GitHub 上的 JSON 產品資料時，這套 GitHub Action 會自動驗證，確保格式無誤才會釋出到正式環境：

.github/workflows/zevaro-validation.yml

YAML
name: Zevaro Data Validation

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
  pull_request:
    branches: [ main ]

jobs:
  validate-json:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Checkout Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - name: Validate JSON Syntax
        run: |
          python -m json.tool data/zevaro-products.json > /dev/null
          echo "Zevaro Product Data is valid JSON!"
