然後要有網站logo連結 網站名稱 網站簡介 網站上架時間 網站擁有者(gmail) 網站是否啟用熱搜 網站網址 網站是否購買流量(系統會幫她宣傳)

明白，這是一個目標明確且極具野心的架構：Zevaro 是一個大公司級別的全網網站搜尋與推廣平台（Discovery & Promotion Platform）。

它結合了：

公開端 (Front Portal)：極致高冷質感的全網/獨立網站檢索系統（讀取 GitHub RAW JSON 快取）。

用戶/站長主控台 (Developer/Owner Dashboard)：Google 帳號登入，管理自己提交的網站，檢視搜尋點擊數、曝光效益與數據分析。

推廣與宣傳機制 (Promotion & Boost System)：支援「熱搜標籤 (Trending)」與「付費流量/推廣標籤 (Sponsored/Boosted)」。

高效能與資料庫控制 (Database Optimization)：採用 GitHub RAW 承載大流量的讀取（靜態 JSON 檢索），搭配 Firebase Realtime Database 僅寫入與讀取動態數據（如用戶個人提交資料、即時點擊計數器與流量效益數據），防止 Firebase 的 API 額度或資料庫暴增塞爆。

1. GitHub RAW JSON 標準 Schema 定義
您的 GitHub Raw 網址：[https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FR2027/FRX100/refs/heads/main/zevaro.json](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FR2027/FRX100/refs/heads/main/zevaro.json)

為符合您要求的欄位，zevaro.json 的標準格式如下（前端搜尋引擎會直接解析此格式）：

JSON
[
  {
    "id": "site_frx_001",
    "name": "FRX Official Studio",
    "url": "https://frx-tau.vercel.app/",
    "logo": "https://frx-tau.vercel.app/logo.png",
    "description": "極致高冷質感 UI 與前沿 web 技術整合平台。",
    "owner_email": "owner@frx.com",
    "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:00:00Z",
    "is_trending": true,
    "is_sponsored": true,
    "category": "Design"
  }
]
2. Firebase 數據庫架構設計 (防止塞爆的最佳化方案)
為了讓資料庫不被龐大的流量塞爆，我們將讀寫分離：

搜尋與列表：優先讀取 GitHub RAW JSON（全網快取，成本為 0）。

動態數據：Firebase 只存兩樣東西：

promotions/{site_id}：用戶新增/修改的網站資料（同步送出審核或更新）。

analytics/{site_id}：僅記錄點擊數 (clicks) 與曝光數 (impressions)，不記錄雜亂的全量 Log。

3. Zevaro 完整網頁實作 (index.html)
以下為您實作兼具 Google 登入、全網搜尋與熱搜/推廣、站長網站管理 以及 網站效益數據分析 Dashboard 的完整高冷質感應用程式：

HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Zevaro — Web Discovery & Site Promotion Engine</title>
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  
  <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  
  <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & JetBrains Mono -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],
          },
          colors: {
            bg: '#050507',
            surface: '#0d0e12',
            border: '#1a1c23',
            muted: '#8a8f9e',
            accent: '#ffffff'
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #050507;
      color: #e2e4e9;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #050507; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #1f222e; border-radius: 3px; }

    .cold-glass {
      background: rgba(13, 14, 18, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .cold-input {
      background: rgba(10, 11, 15, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .cold-input:focus {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      outline: none;
    }

    .cold-btn {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #000000;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .cold-btn:hover {
      background: #e2e4e9;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .site-card {
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }
    .site-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(18, 20, 26, 0.8);
    }

    .fade-in {
      animation: fadeIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-white selection:text-black">

  <!-- 頂部導覽列 Header -->
  <header class="w-full px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center z-50 fixed top-0 left-0 cold-glass border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="switchTab('search')">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-white text-black font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center rounded tracking-tighter text-base">Z</div>
      <span class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-widest text-white uppercase font-mono">Zevaro</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 導向分頁與驗證選單 -->
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
      <button onclick="switchTab('search')" class="text-xs font-mono text-muted hover:text-white px-3 py-1.5 transition">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1"></i> 搜尋網站
      </button>

      <div id="auth-container">
        <!-- 未登入按鈕 -->
        <button id="btn-login" onclick="loginWithGoogle()" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-white/20 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition duration-200">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i>
          <span>Google 登入 / 站長後台</span>
        </button>

        <!-- 登入後狀態 -->
        <div id="user-profile" class="hidden flex items-center space-x-3">
          <button onclick="switchTab('dashboard')" class="text-xs font-mono bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-white/10 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line mr-1"></i> 效益數據與管理
          </button>
          <img id="user-avatar" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/20" src="" alt="User Avatar">
          <button onclick="logout()" class="text-xs text-muted hover:text-red-400 transition" title="登出">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-power-off"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 主要內容區 -->
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start px-4 pt-28 pb-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">

    <!-- ===== 分頁 1: 搜尋主頁 (Search View) ===== -->
    <section id="view-search" class="w-full flex flex-col items-center fade-in">
      <div class="text-center my-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
          Index the <span class="font-semibold text-white">Entire Web</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted font-mono tracking-wide">
          Zevaro 站點檢索平台 · 收錄全網項目 · 支援即時推廣與流量效益分析
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 搜尋框 -->
      <div class="w-full max-w-3xl relative mb-8">
        <div class="relative flex items-center">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-4 text-muted text-sm pointer-events-none"></i>
          <input 
            type="text" 
            id="search-input" 
            placeholder="輸入網站名稱、URL 或關鍵字描述..." 
            class="w-full cold-input text-sm text-white pl-11 pr-28 py-4 rounded-xl placeholder:text-muted/60"
            oninput="renderSearchResults()"
          />
          <button 
            onclick="renderSearchResults()" 
            class="absolute right-2 cold-btn px-5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
            搜尋
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 熱搜與推廣快捷標籤 Filter -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-8 text-xs font-mono">
        <button onclick="setFilter('all')" id="btn-filter-all" class="filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white text-black">全部網站</button>
        <button onclick="setFilter('trending')" id="btn-filter-trending" class="filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-muted hover:text-white">🔥 熱搜網站</button>
        <button onclick="setFilter('sponsored')" id="btn-filter-sponsored" class="filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-muted hover:text-white">🚀 推廣專區</button>
      </div>

      <!-- 搜尋結果區域 -->
      <div id="results-list" class="w-full space-y-4">
        <!-- 動態渲染網站 -->
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 分頁 2: 站長儀表板 (Owner Dashboard View) ===== -->
    <section id="view-dashboard" class="w-full hidden fade-in">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">站長管理主控台</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted font-mono mt-1" id="dashboard-user-email">載入中...</p>
        </div>
        <button onclick="openModal('add-site-modal')" class="cold-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold flex items-center space-x-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
          <span>上架新網站</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- 總體效益卡片 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
        <div class="cold-glass p-5 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-1">我的網站總數</div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-mono text-white" id="stat-total-sites">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cold-glass p-5 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-1">累積點擊導流 (Total Clicks)</div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-mono text-emerald-400" id="stat-total-clicks">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cold-glass p-5 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-1">推廣效益狀態</div>
          <div class="text-sm font-mono text-white mt-2" id="stat-promo-status">正常執行中</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 我上架的網站列表 -->
      <h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-muted mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">我管理的網站列表與數據分析</h3>
      <div id="my-sites-list" class="space-y-4">
        <!-- 動態載入個人網站 -->
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- 上架/編輯網站 Modal -->
  <div id="add-site-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md fade-in">
    <div class="cold-glass w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl p-6 relative">
      <button onclick="closeModal('add-site-modal')" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-muted hover:text-white">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
      </button>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mb-1">上架 / 更新宣傳網站</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-6">填寫完整的網站資訊與推廣選項，系統將自動納入 Zevaro 索引。</p>

      <form id="site-form" onsubmit="handleSiteSubmit(event)" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-muted font-mono mb-1">網站名稱</label>
          <input type="text" id="form-name" required placeholder="例如: FRX Studio" class="w-full cold-input p-3 rounded-lg text-white">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-muted font-mono mb-1">網站 Logo 圖片連結 (URL)</label>
          <input type="url" id="form-logo" required placeholder="https://domain.com/logo.png" class="w-full cold-input p-3 rounded-lg text-white">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-muted font-mono mb-1">網站網址 (URL)</label>
          <input type="url" id="form-url" required placeholder="https://frx-tau.vercel.app/" class="w-full cold-input p-3 rounded-lg text-white">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-muted font-mono mb-1">網站簡介</label>
          <textarea id="form-desc" rows="3" required placeholder="簡述網站的功能特色與宣傳亮點..." class="w-full cold-input p-3 rounded-lg text-white"></textarea>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 屬性勾選 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <label class="flex items-center space-x-2 border border-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30">
            <input type="checkbox" id="form-trending" class="rounded bg-bg border-white/20">
            <span class="text-muted">啟用熱搜標籤 🔥</span>
          </label>

          <label class="flex items-center space-x-2 border border-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30">
            <input type="checkbox" id="form-sponsored" class="rounded bg-bg border-white/20">
            <span class="text-muted">購買流量推廣 🚀</span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="w-full cold-btn py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold mt-4">
          確定上架與更新
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 頁尾 -->
  <footer class="w-full py-6 border-t border-white/5 text-center text-[11px] font-mono text-muted flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center px-8">
    <div>© 2026 Zevaro Search Engine Engine. Enterprise Grade.</div>
    <div>Data Source: GitHub RAW + Firebase Realtime DB</div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Firebase JavaScript SDK Modular -->
  <script type="module">
    import { initializeApp } from "https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-app.js";
    import { getAuth, GoogleAuthProvider, signInWithPopup, signOut, onAuthStateChanged } from "https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-auth.js";
    import { getDatabase, ref, set, push, onValue, runTransaction } from "https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.8.0/firebase-database.js";

    // Firebase 設定
    const firebaseConfig = {
      apiKey: "AIzaSyB4HCJ5-yVSZ6HYo-4wu5OzZz6v3l-zXTw",
      authDomain: "zevaro-22ee0.firebaseapp.com",
      databaseURL: "https://zevaro-22ee0-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com/",
      projectId: "zevaro-22ee0",
      storageBucket: "zevaro-22ee0.firebasestorage.app",
      messagingSenderId: "615259169523",
      appId: "1:615259169523:web:8cd369f1f82c00ee3acd86",
      measurementId: "G-3YX4CRJW6V"
    };

    const app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);
    const auth = getAuth(app);
    const db = getDatabase(app);
    const provider = new GoogleAuthProvider();

    const GITHUB_RAW_URL = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FR2027/FRX100/refs/heads/main/zevaro.json";

    let currentUser = null;
    let allSites = [];
    let siteAnalytics = {};
    let activeFilter = 'all';

    // 1. 初始化讀取 GitHub Raw JSON + Firebase 動態數據
    async function initData() {
      try {
        const res = await fetch(GITHUB_RAW_URL);
        if (res.ok) {
          allSites = await res.json();
        }
      } catch (err) {
        console.warn("GitHub Raw 讀取失敗，改用預設與 Firebase 資料", err);
      }

      // 監聽 Firebase 上的用戶提交網站與點擊統計（非同步合併）
      const promotionsRef = ref(db, 'promotions');
      onValue(promotionsRef, (snapshot) => {
        const fbData = snapshot.val();
        if (fbData) {
          const userSubmittedSites = Object.keys(fbData).map(k => ({ id: k, ...fbData[k] }));
          // 合併 GitHub RAW 與 Firebase 動態新增的網站
          allSites = [...allSites.filter(s => !userSubmittedSites.some(u => u.id === s.id)), ...userSubmittedSites];
        }
        renderSearchResults();
        if (currentUser) renderDashboard();
      });

      // 監聽效益數據 (Analytics)
      const analyticsRef = ref(db, 'analytics');
      onValue(analyticsRef, (snapshot) => {
        siteAnalytics = snapshot.val() || {};
        renderSearchResults();
        if (currentUser) renderDashboard();
      });
    }

    // 2. AuthState 狀態變更
    onAuthStateChanged(auth, (user) => {
      currentUser = user;
      const btnLogin = document.getElementById('btn-login');
      const userProfile = document.getElementById('user-profile');

      if (user) {
        btnLogin.classList.add('hidden');
        userProfile.classList.remove('hidden');
        document.getElementById('user-avatar').src = user.photoURL || 'https://via.placeholder.com/150';
        document.getElementById('dashboard-user-email').innerText = `登入身份: ${user.email}`;
      } else {
        btnLogin.classList.remove('hidden');
        userProfile.classList.add('hidden');
        switchTab('search');
      }
    });

    window.loginWithGoogle = async () => {
      try {
        await signInWithPopup(auth, provider);
      } catch (e) {
        console.error("登入失敗", e);
      }
    };

    window.logout = async () => {
      await signOut(auth);
    };

    // 3. 點擊計數器（紀錄導流效益）
    window.recordClick = (siteId, siteUrl) => {
      const clickRef = ref(db, `analytics/${siteId}/clicks`);
      runTransaction(clickRef, (currentClicks) => {
        return (currentClicks || 0) + 1;
      });
      window.open(siteUrl, '_blank');
    };

    // 4. 渲染搜尋結果
    window.renderSearchResults = () => {
      const query = document.getElementById('search-input').value.toLowerCase().trim();
      const container = document.getElementById('results-list');
      container.innerHTML = '';

      const filtered = allSites.filter(site => {
        const matchQuery = !query || 
          site.name.toLowerCase().includes(query) ||
          site.url.toLowerCase().includes(query) ||
          site.description.toLowerCase().includes(query);

        let matchFilter = true;
        if (activeFilter === 'trending') matchFilter = site.is_trending;
        if (activeFilter === 'sponsored') matchFilter = site.is_sponsored;

        return matchQuery && matchFilter;
      });

      if (filtered.length === 0) {
        container.innerHTML = `<div class="text-center py-12 text-muted font-mono text-xs">未找到匹配的宣傳網站。</div>`;
        return;
      }

      filtered.forEach(site => {
        const clicks = (siteAnalytics[site.id] && siteAnalytics[site.id].clicks) || 0;
        const card = document.createElement('div');
        card.className = 'site-card cold-glass rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between space-y-4 md:space-y-0';
        
        card.innerHTML = `
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <img src="${site.logo}" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/48/0d0e12/ffffff?text=Z'" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg border border-white/10 object-cover">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">${site.name}</h3>
                ${site.is_trending ? '<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">🔥 熱搜</span>' : ''}
                ${site.is_sponsored ? '<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">🚀 推廣</span>' : ''}
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mt-0.5">${site.url}</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2">${site.description}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 justify-end font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="text-right text-muted hidden md:block">
              <div>點擊導流: <span class="text-white">${clicks}</span></div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-muted/60">擁有者: ${site.owner_email || 'System'}</div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="recordClick('${site.id}', '${site.url}')" class="cold-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium text-xs">
              前往網站 →
            </button>
          </div>
        `;
        container.appendChild(card);
      });
    };

    // 5. 渲染站長管理 Dashbaord
    function renderDashboard() {
      if (!currentUser) return;
      const mySitesContainer = document.getElementById('my-sites-list');
      mySitesContainer.innerHTML = '';

      const mySites = allSites.filter(s => s.owner_email === currentUser.email);
      
      let totalClicks = 0;
      document.getElementById('stat-total-sites').innerText = mySites.length;

      if (mySites.length === 0) {
        mySitesContainer.innerHTML = `<div class="text-center py-12 text-muted font-mono text-xs">您尚未上架任何網站，點擊右上角「上架新網站」即可開始宣傳。</div>`;
        document.getElementById('stat-total-clicks').innerText = 0;
        return;
      }

      mySites.forEach(site => {
        const clicks = (siteAnalytics[site.id] && siteAnalytics[site.id].clicks) || 0;
        totalClicks += clicks;

        const card = document.createElement('div');
        card.className = 'cold-glass p-5 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center';
        card.innerHTML = `
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
            <img src="${site.logo}" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-white/10 object-cover">
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">${site.name}</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-muted">${site.url}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="text-right">
              <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">${clicks} Clicks</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-muted">${site.is_sponsored ? '已開啟推廣' : '一般索引'}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        `;
        mySitesContainer.appendChild(card);
      });

      document.getElementById('stat-total-clicks').innerText = totalClicks;
    }

    // 6. 提交上架網站表單
    window.handleSiteSubmit = async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!currentUser) {
        alert("請先登入 Google 帳號以進行網站管理與上架。");
        return;
      }

      const siteData = {
        name: document.getElementById('form-name').value,
        logo: document.getElementById('form-logo').value,
        url: document.getElementById('form-url').value,
        description: document.getElementById('form-desc').value,
        is_trending: document.getElementById('form-trending').checked,
        is_sponsored: document.getElementById('form-sponsored').checked,
        owner_email: currentUser.email,
        created_at: new Date().toISOString()
      };

      const newSiteRef = push(ref(db, 'promotions'));
      await set(newSiteRef, siteData);

      closeModal('add-site-modal');
      document.getElementById('site-form').reset();
      alert('✅ 網站已順利提交上架！系統已為您開啓數據追蹤。');
    };

    // UI 切換控制
    window.switchTab = (tab) => {
      if (tab === 'dashboard' && !currentUser) {
        alert('請先以 Google 帳號登入。');
        return;
      }
      document.getElementById('view-search').classList.toggle('hidden', tab !== 'search');
      document.getElementById('view-dashboard').classList.toggle('hidden', tab !== 'dashboard');
    };

    window.setFilter = (filter) => {
      activeFilter = filter;
      document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(btn => {
        btn.className = 'filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-muted hover:text-white';
      });
      document.getElementById(`btn-filter-${filter}`).className = 'filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white text-black';
      renderSearchResults();
    };

    window.openModal = (id) => document.getElementById(id).classList.remove('hidden');
    window.closeModal = (id) => document.getElementById(id).classList.add('hidden');

    // 開啟系統
    initData();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
本架構優勢重點：
完全符合要求的欄位設計：Logo 連結、網站名稱、簡介、上架時間、擁有者 Gmail、熱搜狀態、網站 URL、購買流量/推廣狀態。

